# goal-interval-inherit: Issue 85 (task-202608310905, bug #1) regression fixture.
# Proves that `swarm_set_goal({ text })` inherits the prior goal's nudgeIntervalMs when no explicit
# intervalMs is passed (was: silently reset to 5s default). Live incident 2026-08-31 09:00 emitted
# 3 nudges in 15s because a text-only replacement dropped a tuned 600000ms cadence back to default.
#
# Lane seeding: orchestrator session only (no other agents needed). The harness reads the durable
# `swarm-state.json` after turn 3 to assert the post-emit interval value.
